  "description": "The ABSOLUT 24 offers a build suited to smaller riders looking for a pumptrack / dirt bike truly designed for them:\n• The X-FUSION Roamin 24 fork is specifically designed for lightweight riders thanks to a dedicated air spring and hydraulic cartridge. It benefits from a sufficiently stiff chassis with 34mm stanchions. Rebound and compression are adjustable.\n• The TEKTRO piston rear brake delivers excellent feel and great reliability. This hydraulic brake uses mineral oil.\n• Grip thickness, handlebar width, and crank length are all sized for smaller riders.\n• WTB rims paired with NOVATEC hubs are renowned for their reliability, lap after lap.",
